{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_01",
  "title": "我有一个荣美家乡",
  "storyCode": "HE-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "466c1e61492891bcbbf2b76b4b91351139d65c85f69c15ae39ade9e09d593f94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（莱蒙德那家伙，神神秘秘的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（有什么事情不能现在说，还非要等到晚上啊？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搞不懂，算了，先不管他了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（今天这么晚才送吃的过去，蕾缪安小姐大概要饿坏了吧......唉，而且还只有这么一点。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（争气一点，我的肚子！别叫了别叫了，不是刚刚吃过东西吗！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唉......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真想有一天，能什么都不管地大吃一顿......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁在那边？我已经发现你了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底是谁躲在那边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算不出声我也知道有人在，我、我看到了！你不是修道院的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快点出来！再、再不出来，我就要喊人......不对，我就要扣下扳机了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好，我出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，失策了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你眼睛可真尖，是我的光翼不小心露出来了吗？我就说我们萨科塔这人人不同款的光环和光翼真的很容易暴露身形......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，我还以为在这里行动不需要那么谨慎呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我之前没见过你，你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好啊，女士。先把铳放下吧，这可不是好女孩该用来指着同族的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你也是萨科塔，那你应该能明白吧，我对你完全没有恶意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是，呃，这次可以算得上是正义使者？差不多吧，毕竟算是来救人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不愿意说就算了。我现在就喊人来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎，你别急啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（放开我！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题，不过你可别真的大叫哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，有点没控制住力道。你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......咳咳，你到底是什么人，想干什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉你也没什么，我是来找人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来找一个和我们一样的萨科塔，粉色头发，现在应该还坐着轮椅吧，人看起来特别和善，不过其实性格没那么好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是蕾缪安小姐？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？看你的表情......你们认识？我的运气还是挺不错的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚刚端着饭菜，是要给谁送去吗？我随便猜猜，难道是送去给蕾缪安的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她是怎么知道的？？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我又猜对啦？你的表情也太明显了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那能不能请你告诉我，这位蕾缪安小姐这段时间过得还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想说？还是不能说？你在犹豫，还有点害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你别乱说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不是乱说，你自己最清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好像有很多烦恼的样子，真奇怪，我本来以为住在这种与世隔绝的地方，不会有很多烦心事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因为什么？因为这里没有多少同族，所以和其他人起了争执吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......和你没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是吗？那是因为你手里那把守护铳看上去好久没保养，有点生锈了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是因为这个的话，我倒是可以帮你哦，我还挺擅长维修铳的呢。只要你告诉我蕾缪安到底在哪里就行了，是不是很划算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我吧，你其实也能猜到我是什么身份，对吧？你看起来挺聪明的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和蕾缪安小姐一样，是拉特兰派来的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，闲聊就到此为止。我还赶时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的不告诉我蕾缪安在哪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，既然你不愿意说，那就算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送吃的这活，就交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就这样，再见啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g4_gatheringplace_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后一个，这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些人是......强盗？还挺能折腾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费德里科，你那边怎么样？我好像听到很大的动静，你没破坏建筑吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那太好了。辛苦了，我这边的也都解决了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太感谢了，你们真的很厉害......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样一来，那群强盗应该就会老实一阵子了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听你这么说，这应该不是你们第一次被骚扰了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们经常遇到这样的情况吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们是从拉特兰来的，那应该知道到这的路有多难走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是有载具，恐怕我们也没法顺利进入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了走投无路的人，没人会愿意在这种地方晃荡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们也看到了，这片荒野上除了这座修道院外什么都没有，那些混账东西一旦发现我们，怎么可能会放过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，现在快入冬了，他们只会来得更勤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，我记得班尼上次右腿伤得不轻，他现在怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有点瘸，只能熬着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，对了，这两位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是来自拉特兰的，嗯，应该勉强算是使者吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是拉特兰来的客人......该怎么称呼两位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰公证所执行者费德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "执行者里凯莱。我们还有一位同行人，不过她已经先行一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费德里科先生，里凯莱先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看起来一点也不吃惊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，因为大家都清楚拉特兰一定会再派人前来，只不过没有人能确定来的会是什么样的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来还以为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高瘦文弱的中年人不自觉地看向两名拉特兰来客手中的铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来以为拉特兰会直接派人来问罪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "问罪？你们犯了什么罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在中庭公证所，大多数罪犯只要能自首，并取得行为对象的谅解，都可以获得减刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自、自首？减刑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？你这混账在说什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，费德里科！现在情况还不明，这些都等找到蕾缪安和奥伦之后再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我们想见这里的负责人，能麻烦你通报一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好的！请稍等，我这就去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢两位的帮助，你们要找的人是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，来迟一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主教阁下！还有杰拉尔德......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杰拉尔德老大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您就是这座修道院的主教阁下？这位，呃，杰拉尔德先生也是这里的负责人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我确实不是那么了不起的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道各位一定有许多问题想问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请移步，让我们换一个更适合的地方谈话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克莱芒，请把大门关上，暂时不要让其他人靠近这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，主教阁下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱蒙德，你继续去做你该做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行，老大你多小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就在门口等着你们......有什么事的话，随时可以叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，这样就不会有人打扰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是这里的主教斯特凡诺·托雷格罗萨，兼任这座修道院的院长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位客人远道而来，招待不周......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必进行无意义的寒暄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受教宗伊万杰利斯塔十一世阁下嘱托，我与同僚前来寻找两位拉特兰特使。请回答：蕾缪安与奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯身处何处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我只能告诉你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾缪安特使正在修道院内做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不用担心，我们不会无礼地对待客人，她非常安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没有提及奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥伦特使的下落......这该是我想要问的才是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道不是奥伦特使联系了拉特兰，两位才会到得如此迅速吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，主教阁下，这和我们收到的情报有些冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们收到的情报是，位于荒原上的安布罗修修道院向拉特兰发送了一封求救信，随后我们向此地派出了两位特使，但他们双双失去联系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因此，教宗阁下特派我们前来寻人并调查情况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到这里为止，与您所知的信息有什么冲突的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们没能留住奥伦特使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是，奥伦并未被限制行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这点我可以作证。那位奥伦特使警戒心很强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在“邀请”蕾缪安小姐留下做客时，他趁我们的人不注意，自包围之中逃脱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也不清楚他之后去了哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥伦跑了，但不露面，也没有联络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有没有点什么不太好的预感？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你别光“嗯”啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有这位披着斗篷的朋友，我想一般居民应该不会知道得这么多吧，你到底是什么身份？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是这里的猎户代表，兼护卫吧。可以不用在意我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，嗯，暂时就当是这么回事好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥伦的事暂且不提。关于蕾缪安特使，我需要一个合理的解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么修道院会限制一位前来援助的拉特兰特使的行动？我将根据你的回答，判断接下来该如何采取行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......两位既然是拉特兰的使者，应该都清楚这座修道院的背景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅限于任务资料上有记载的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十多年前......我们为躲避天灾而误入这片荒野，燃料耗尽，整座修道院被困在此处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无法沟通外界，我们只能自己尝试耕种。但这里的土壤本就贫瘠，到了今天，地里已经长不出多少粮食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不仅如此，荒原上的野兽以及比野兽更凶残的劫掠者都是巨大的威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时的我们别无选择......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因此，你们选择收留荒原上的流浪者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“收留”这个词太过傲慢。不，不是收留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们只是接纳那些无家可归的人。人们因种种缘由失去了可以回去的地方，那我们就再给他们一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯特凡诺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打断一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一件事情需要确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，费德里科，你打算干什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "执行者阁下！你这是在做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确认完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也太乱来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，这还真是个大发现。主教阁下，可以解释一下这是怎么一回事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
